This project packages Omarchy into a container. It contains no Omarchy source
code and redistributes no Omarchy binaries.

  Omarchy — https://omarchy.org  ·  https://github.com/basecamp/omarchy
  Copyright (c) Basecamp / David Heinemeier Hansson. MIT licensed.

What this repo contains is a build harness: scripts that read an Omarchy
installer ISO you supply yourself, install packages from the offline pacman
mirror that ISO already carries, and configure the result to run headless in a
container. The ISO is NOT included and is excluded by .gitignore.

Packages installed at build time come from:
  * the ISO's own bundled offline mirror (Arch + Omarchy packages), and
  * the Arch Linux Archive snapshot matching the ISO's build date, for the
    handful of packages the mirror does not carry (wayvnc, neatvnc, aml,
    vulkan-swrast, sway, swaybg).

Those packages remain under their respective upstream licenses. noVNC (MPL-2.0)
and websockify (LGPL-3.0) are downloaded from their upstream release tarballs at
build time and are likewise not redistributed here.
